.SH NAME
lmm-profile-sync - Sync profile to match installed mods


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlmm profile sync [name] [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Update the profile YAML to match currently installed/enabled mods in the database.

.PP
Use this if the profile got out of sync, or to migrate from pre-profile installs.
If no name is given, uses the current/default profile.

.PP
Examples:
  lmm profile sync --game skyrim-se
  lmm profile sync survival --game skyrim-se


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for sync


